              <a href="/april-15-1904-new-organization" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25);color:var(--red-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:0.83rem;">Full 1904 Evidence Page &rarr;</a>
